```

You can verify the non-secret values inside the container:

```bash
docker compose \
  --env-file .env.production \
  -f docker-compose.production.yml \
  exec app sh -lc \
  'env | grep -E "^(NODE_ENV|FRONTEND_URL|GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID|GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL)="'
```

